@startuml
title VideoHub Architecture - Component Diagram

actor User

rectangle "VideoHub System" {

  [Frontend\n(Next.js)] as FE
  [API Gateway\n(Express)] as GW
  [Auth Service] as AUTH
  [Video Service] as VS
  [Comment Service] as CS
  [Search Service] as SS
  [Notification Service] as NS
  [Data Access Layer\n(Prisma)] as DAL
  database "PostgreSQL" as DB

  () "IRestApi" as IRestApi
  () "IAuth" as IAuth
  () "IVideoOps" as IVideoOps
  () "ICommentOps" as ICommentOps
  () "ISearch" as ISearch
  () "ISearchIndex" as ISearchIndex
  () "INotify" as INotify
  () "IDataAccess" as IDataAccess

  GW - IRestApi
  AUTH - IAuth
  VS - IVideoOps
  CS - ICommentOps
  SS - ISearch
  SS - ISearchIndex
  NS - INotify
  DAL - IDataAccess
}

[Google OAuth] as GOOGLE
[Email/SMS Gateway] as EMAIL

() "IGoogleOAuth" as IGoogleOAuth
() "IEmailGateway" as IEmailGateway
GOOGLE - IGoogleOAuth
EMAIL - IEmailGateway

User --> FE : uses
FE ..> IRestApi
GW ..> IAuth : requires
GW ..> IVideoOps : requires
GW ..> ICommentOps : requires
GW ..> ISearch : requires
VS ..> INotify : requires
VS ..> ISearchIndex : requires
AUTH ..> IDataAccess : requires
VS ..> IDataAccess : requires
CS ..> IDataAccess : requires
SS ..> IDataAccess : requires
DAL --> DB : persists
AUTH ..> IGoogleOAuth : requires
NS ..> IEmailGateway : requires

@enduml
